---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Scott's Electric (Hampton Roads 757)"
  description="Privacy Policy for Scott's Electric. Learn how we handle form inquiries, 757 electrical service requests, and Google Analytics data."
>
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-card to-brand-dark border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-brand-gold mt-2">Last Updated: July 2026 • Scott's Electric (Hampton Roads, VA)</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-dark">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          Scott's Electric collects personal information that you voluntarily provide when submitting an online quote request, scheduling an electrical appointment, or contacting our 24/7 dispatch hotline. This information includes your full name, phone number, email address, physical address, and service details.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          We use your information solely to deliver requested electrical services, provide budget estimate calculations, schedule Master Electrician dispatches across Hampton Roads (Virginia Beach, Norfolk, Chesapeake, Newport News, Hampton, Portsmouth, and Suffolk), and communicate regarding project updates.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Netlify Forms & Service Data</h2>
        <p>
          Online quote requests and contact form submissions are processed securely using Netlify Forms. Form data is transmitted securely and is never sold, leased, or rented to third-party marketing companies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">4. Analytics & Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to collect anonymous website traffic data, user interaction metrics, and page performance information. Google Analytics uses first-party cookies to help analyze how visitors navigate Scott's Electric. This data helps us improve user experience, site speed, and service accessibility across 757. You may opt out of Google Analytics tracking by adjusting your browser cookie settings or using Google's opt-out browser add-on.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or your data, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@scottselectric.pro" class="text-brand-gold underline">info@scottselectric.pro</a> or call <a href="tel:7575360478" class="text-brand-gold underline">(757) 536-0478</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
